From 6c4cfc34f2c08da2bb709be5ba8a3224152273bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MT6762 local experiment <mt6762-build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:48:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm: add opt-in power and SSPM laboratory fixtures

AI-assisted local experiment, not intended for upstream submission. Adds timed synthetic WACS2/ADC, keypad level/fault tests, and bounded PLATFORM mailbox response fixtures. No physical battery, charging safety, CPU-DVFS, SSPM firmware or phone compatibility is claimed.
